{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/965590/extras/07d88dcfa083e1bbf9d367fce6f7d5d0.avif?t=1767903067\" width=616 height=352 /></span><br>Bring your stained glass masterpiece to dazzling digital life in Sagrada, the dice-drafting board game from Floodgate Games.<br><br>Take turns selecting colorful dice and placing them in your gorgeous stained-glass window. The artisan who creates the most beautiful window wins.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your dice carefully!</h2>Find the perfect fit for each piece of your window: restrictions on both the color and number showing on your die make for a puzzling challenge.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use your tools!</h2>As a master artisan, your tools-of-the-trade will help you shape the dice available.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please your admirers!</h2>Adapt to the fickle demands of your patrons -- while keeping your signature artistic flair -- for additional prestige.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/965590/extras/cd1af32c7bab4b7e0d5e47b83b6930b7.avif?t=1767903067\" width=609 height=70 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"058b7321909e4c2e75863248e3f4fcd8c46d6e3a.jpg","localized_name":"Fractal Drops","name":"Fractal Drops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/965590/058b7321909e4c2e75863248e3f4fcd8c46d6e3a.jpg"},{"icon":"30767f6455fcfe601b576cbad1d01d2ba655e1d5.jpg","localized_name":"Sun Catcher","name":"Sun Catcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/965590/30767f6455fcfe601b576cbad1d01d2ba655e1d5.jpg"},{"icon":"492fe15dd499636b516f7cc05218fe6d1e6783b1.jpg","localized_name":"Bellesguard","name":"Bellesguard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/965590/492fe15dd499636b516f7cc05218fe6d1e6783b1.jpg"},{"icon":"fd94